s in the women’s individual and mixed team normal hills.  Both Japan, thanks to " [:a {:href "/athletes/137476"} "Ryōyū Kobayashi"] ", and Austria, led by " [:a {:href "/athletes/136742"} "Manuel Fettner"] ", took one silver each, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/2301714"} "Marius Lindvik"] " earning Norway’s lone victory by taking gold in the large hill. Germany won three medals, albeit none of the gold, with Russia, Poland, and Canada taking one of the medals each – a first Olympic podium finish in the sport for the latter nation."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/19020630"} "Normal Hill, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "5 –  6 February 2022"] "\n" [:td {} "53"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/19020635"} "Large Hill, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 – 12 February 2022"] "\n" [:td {} "56"] "\n" [:td {} "20"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/19020640"} "Large Hill, Team, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 February 2022"] "\n" [:td {} "44"] "\n" [:td {} "11"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/19020643"} "Normal Hill, Individual, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 5 February 2022"] "\n" [:td {} "40"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/19020646"} "Normal Hill, Team, Mixed"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 February 2022"] "\n" [:td {} "40"] "\n" [:td {} "10"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n104 (64/40)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n22 (20/16)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n